# pIDS-homelab custom Suricata rules
#
# sid 9000001 - Lab test rule (first custom detection)
# Purpose:  Verify Suricata is capturing traffic and loading custom rules.
# Detects:  HTTP requests whose User-Agent contains "pids-test".
# Trigger:  curl -s -A "pids-test" http://example.com > /dev/null
# Tested:   2026-11-11 - alert fired in fast.log as expected.
# Note:     sids 9000000+ are reserved for local/custom rules.
alert http any any -> any any (msg:"PIDS LAB - test user agent"; http.user_agent; content:"pids-test"; sid:9000001; rev:1;)
